WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.236
HOLLYWOOD POLICE DEPARTMENT IF

00:00:02.237 --> 00:00:04.054
YOU HAVE ANY INFORMATION.

00:00:04.088 --> 00:00:06.938
&gt;&gt; WE WILL STAY HERE AS LONG AS

00:00:06.939 --> 00:00:08.625
IT TAKES TO GET AN AGREEMENT.

00:00:08.627 --> 00:00:11.159
AND WE URGE MR. MEADOWS TO SIT

00:00:11.160 --> 00:00:13.324
DOWN AND CONTINUE TO WORK WITH

00:00:13.325 --> 00:00:16.646
US TO DO IT AS LONG AS IT TAKES.

00:00:16.680 --> 00:00:18.751
&gt;&gt; BY FRIDAY IF WE HAVEN’T MADE

00:00:18.752 --> 00:00:20.168
SIGNIFICANT PROGRESS AND WE’RE

00:00:20.169 --> 00:00:21.760
JUST TOO FAR APART, THE

00:00:21.761 --> 00:00:23.730
PRESIDENT IS PREPARED TO TAKE

00:00:23.764 --> 00:00:24.541
EXECUTIVE ACTION.

00:00:24.575 --> 00:00:28.187
&gt;&gt; Sandra: NO DEAL YET ON THE

00:00:28.221 --> 00:00:29.449
NEXT CORONAVIRUS RELEASE BILL.

00:00:29.450 --> 00:00:31.060
DEMOCRATS AND REPUBLICANS STILL

00:00:31.061 --> 00:00:32.417
NEGOTIATING ON CAPITOL HILL.

00:00:32.419 --> 00:00:34.251
MARK MEADOWS SAYS IF AN

00:00:34.253 --> 00:00:36.136
AGREEMENT IS NOT REACHED BY
TOMORROW IT IS DOUBTFUL THERE

00:00:36.137 --> 00:00:38.097
TOMORROW IT IS DOUBTFUL THERE

00:00:38.098 --> 00:00:43.948
WILL BE ANY DEAL AT ALL.

00:00:43.982 --> 00:00:47.548
CHAD PERGRAM IS LIVE ON CAPITOL

00:00:47.582 --> 00:00:48.101
HILL.

00:00:48.135 --> 00:00:49.801
&gt;&gt; THEY’RE TRILLIONS APART HERE.

00:00:49.835 --> 00:00:50.931
THE NEGOTIATIONS HAVE GONE ON

00:00:50.933 --> 00:00:51.861
FOR DAYS.

00:00:51.862 --> 00:00:53.897
THE ONLY PLACE A MOVEMENT IS ON

00:00:53.898 --> 00:00:54.560
UNEMPLOYMENT INSURANCE.

00:00:54.561 --> 00:00:55.674
THEY’RE A LITTLE BIT CLOSER

00:00:55.709 --> 00:00:56.327
THERE.

00:00:56.361 --> 00:00:58.315
THE LENGTH OF THESE TALKS,

00:00:58.316 --> 00:01:01.570
THAT’S WHAT IS FRUSTRATING MARK

00:01:01.571 --> 00:01:02.176
MEADOWS.

00:01:02.177 --> 00:01:04.899
&gt;&gt; I CAN JUST TELL YOU THAT

00:01:04.900 --> 00:01:07.277
THERE ARE NO TOP LINE NUMBERS

00:01:07.279 --> 00:01:09.523
THAT HAVE BEEN AGREED TO.

00:01:09.525 --> 00:01:14.103
WE CONTINUE TO BE TRILLIONS OF

00:01:14.138 --> 00:01:17.363
DOLLARS APART IN TERMS OF WHAT

00:01:17.398 --> 00:01:18.652
DEMOCRATS AND REPUBLICANS

00:01:18.653 --> 00:01:19.740
HOPEFULLY WILL ULTIMATELY

00:01:19.775 --> 00:01:20.730
COMPROMISE ON.

00:01:20.731 --> 00:01:22.895
&gt;&gt; THIS IS THE THICKET OF

00:01:22.897 --> 00:01:23.846
NEGOTIATIONS WITH DOZENS OF

00:01:23.881 --> 00:01:24.876
THORNY ISSUES.

00:01:24.910 --> 00:01:27.968
THEY ARE NOWHERE CLOSE ON FOOD

00:01:28.002 --> 00:01:29.564
ASSISTANCE, NOT CLOSE ON SCHOOL

00:01:29.598 --> 00:01:29.873
AID.

00:01:29.907 --> 00:01:31.190
ALL THEY’VE ACCOMPLISHED IS

00:01:31.191 --> 00:01:32.713
NARROWED THE LIST OF ISSUES

00:01:32.714 --> 00:01:33.835
WHERE THEY THINK THERE CAN BE

00:01:33.870 --> 00:01:34.699
AN AGREEMENT.

00:01:34.733 --> 00:01:35.708
HOUSE SPEAKER NANCY PELOSI

00:01:35.710 --> 00:01:38.129
CALLED IT AN UNUSUAL

00:01:38.131 --> 00:01:38.406
NEGOTIATION.

00:01:38.440 --> 00:01:40.083
&gt;&gt; I FEEL OPTIMISTIC THAT THERE

00:01:40.117 --> 00:01:41.949
IS A LIGHT AT THE END OF THE

00:01:41.950 --> 00:01:44.191
TUNNEL BUT HOW LONG THAT TUNNEL

00:01:44.225 --> 00:01:45.885
IS REMAINS TO BE SEEN.

00:01:45.886 --> 00:01:47.833
&gt;&gt; THIS IS WHERE IF THERE IS NO

00:01:47.835 --> 00:01:49.090
DEAL THEY COULD TAKE EXECUTIVE

00:01:49.091 --> 00:01:50.776
ACTION OVER THE WEEKEND OR NEXT

00:01:50.810 --> 00:01:52.546
WEEK WHERE THE PRESIDENT HAS

00:01:52.547 --> 00:01:56.336
TALKED MAYBE SANDRA ABOUT A

00:01:56.337 --> 00:01:57.802
MORATORIUM ON EVICTIONS AND

00:01:57.837 --> 00:01:58.936
SUSPENDING THE COLLECTION OF

00:01:58.971 --> 00:01:59.564
PAYROLL TAXES.

00:01:59.565 --> 00:02:01.306
&gt;&gt; Sandra: WHY DO THEY THINK

00:02:01.308 --> 00:02:03.260
THEY CAN GET A DEAL DONE NOW

00:02:03.261 --> 00:02:04.336
AFTER TWO WEEKS OF NEGOTIATIONS?

00:02:04.337 --> 00:02:05.531
&gt;&gt; THEY DON’T.

00:02:05.532 --> 00:02:06.717
THAT’S WHAT IS SO INTERESTING

00:02:06.751 --> 00:02:07.936
ABOUT THIS.

00:02:07.937 --> 00:02:10.132
THIS WAS SUMMED UP BY MEADOWS

00:02:10.166 --> 00:02:11.019
YESTERDAY AFTERNOON.

00:02:11.020 --> 00:02:11.582
LISTEN.

00:02:11.616 --> 00:02:14.639
&gt;&gt; THIS IS NOT A FINE WINE THAT

00:02:14.673 --> 00:02:16.143
DON’T IMPROVE WITH TIME.

00:02:16.178 --> 00:02:18.965
&gt;&gt; THE SENATE HASN’T TRIED TO

00:02:18.999 --> 00:02:20.434
ADVANCE AN INTERIM PLAN ON

00:02:20.468 --> 00:02:21.659
UNEMPLOYMENT INSURANCE DESPITE

00:02:21.661 --> 00:02:22.874
SUGGESTIONS THAT WOULD HAPPEN

00:02:22.875 --> 00:02:24.015
THIS WEEK.

00:02:24.050 --> 00:02:26.211
FOX IS TOLD ANY MEASURE MY ONLY

00:02:26.245 --> 00:02:27.413
COMMAND 40GOP VOTES.

00:02:27.448 --> 00:02:29.440
IF THERE IS NOT AN AGREEMENT

00:02:29.474 --> 00:02:31.407
FOX IS TOLD THE ADMINISTRATION

00:02:31.408 --> 00:02:32.867
COULD TRY TO USE SOME UNUSED

00:02:32.902 --> 00:02:34.271
CORONAVIRUS MONEY FROM OLD

00:02:34.272 --> 00:02:35.809
BILLS BACK IN MARCH.

00:02:35.844 --> 00:02:37.215
ALSO MONEY FROM THE DISASTER

00:02:37.250 --> 00:02:38.559
RELIEF FUND IF THEY CAN’T GET

